  "name": "Servant Summon: Forest Bear",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You gain the [Nature] tag. Gain + [SR &times; 4] to the physical damage rolls you do.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>(Effect): You gain [Barrier: [STR base]].&nbsp;<br>(CR 11): Becomes + [SR &times; 5] instead of + [SR &times; 4].&nbsp;<br>(CR 21): + [SR &times; 7].</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A special skill that summons and uses the ancestral spirit Forest Bear, which embodies the magnificence of nature and the calmness of the forest. A raging guardian, the Forest Bear protects you and slays your foes.</p>",
